                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "\\mathrm{rate}\\;=\\;k_2\\lbrack{\\mathrm N}_2\\mathrm O\\rbrack\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Since Step 1 is fast and reversible (i.e. equilibrium): "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": true,
                    "src": "{\\mathrm{rate}}_{1\\rightarrow}\\;=\\;k_{1\\rightarrow}\\lbrack{\\mathrm N}_2{\\mathrm O}_2\\rbrack\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\;=\\;{\\mathrm{rate}}_{1\\leftarrow}\\;=\\;k_{1\\leftarrow}\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\mathrm O\\rbrack\\lbrack{\\mathrm N}_2\\mathrm O\\rbrack\\;",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Solving this for the intermediate [N"
